+// All calls run on the emulator thread. Pull one mono frame at the requested
+// guest rate; zero on underrun, never block. Units: signed16, 32768 is ADC peak
+// before MGAIN/IPGA (0.6*AVDD Vpp at unity). Internal mic needs MPWRI.
+// A capture driver owns resampling and a bounded queue (at most 250ms), drops
